<title>UK: Goldman sets call warrants on German stocks.</title>
<headline>Goldman sets call warrants on German stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said it has</p>
<p>issued American-style call warrants on two German stocks.</p>
<p>There are 10 million warrants on ordinary shares of Deutsche</p>
<p>Bank AG and five million on ordinary shares of</p>
<p>Heidelberger Zement AG.</p>
<p>DEUTSCHE BANK WARRANTS</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    120 DEM		   PREMIUM	20.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.95 DEM		  GEARING	11.31 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 24.JUL.97-18.DEC.98   PAYDATE	23.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUES/FFT/STUT	   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  107.45 DEM</p>
<p>HEIDELBERGER ZEMENT WARRANTS</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    160 DEM		   PREMIUM	15.48 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.90 DEM		  GEARING	8.16 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 23.JUL.97-04.JAN.99   PAYDATE	22.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUES/FFT/STUT	   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  155 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
